  "id": "diagnostic-formulation",
  "term": "diagnostic formulation",
  "definition": "Diagnostic formulation is the more complete assessment used to work out a diagnosis, as distinct from a brief screening check. In this context, it means choosing assessment tools suited to forming a fuller picture of cognitive problems and their effects.",
